all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $9$ if the sum of its digits is divisible by $9.$\n\nFor the number $173\\,◻32\\,338\\,$ the sum of the digits is\n\n$$\n1+7+3+◻+3+2+3+3+8=30+◻.\n$$\n\nNow, let's consider each of the given digits that could be inserted into the blank.\n\n- If we insert $4$ into the blank, then the sum of the digits is $30+4=34,$ which is *not* divisible by $9.$\n\n- If we insert $6$ into the blank, then the sum of the digits is $30+6=36,$ which is divisible by $9.$\n\n- If we insert $9$ into the blank, then the sum of the digits is $30+9=39,$ which is *not* divisible by $9.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432789 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171933 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b483f9f7-47a9-5725-b1f1-fe0ea39a7e96" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 6"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9060c880-173b-56eb-8b5c-f207d11000e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474338} {:answer/id #uuid "2baed584-6766-5727-b4d5-755a33a351a0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474339}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9060c880-173b-56eb-8b5c-f207d11000e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474338} :answer-field/id #uuid "5699c1fc-bbd9-5f32-999a-f7483dbb6a4b" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475095} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "54faa10a-47a7-590a-9bda-8760e7720749" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474340} {:answer/id #uuid "a3f5e6c7-259d-542f-a72b-4