he sum of its digits is divisible by $3:$\n\n$$\n5+5+3+5+5+6+7+6=42\n$$\n\nSo, $55\\,355\\,676$ is divisible by $6.$\n\n- The number $137\\,252\\,124$ is divisible by $2,$ and it is also divisible by $3$ since the sum of its digits is divisible by $3:$\n\n$$\n1+3+7+2+5+2+1+2+4=27\n$$\n\nSo, $137\\,252\\,124$ is divisible by $6.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432790 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171934 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb0ae539-5348-5a2c-b226-c009ce6d6094" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 7"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "16038b37-fb72-5b4d-a1b9-61faa977017a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474726} {:answer/id #uuid "03bd83fe-2bc5-50c4-8f9c-c0f326589f2f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474727}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "16038b37-fb72-5b4d-a1b9-61faa977017a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474726} :answer-field/id #uuid "3c2069b5-74fd-5c33-940d-8d4fbd791f49" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475289} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e7db56f2-47af-5474-9afc-f735b48ad580" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474728} {:answer/id #uuid "ba5b14e6-0fd7-5cef-90c2-621c945bb93b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474729}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ba5b14e6-0fd7-5cef-90c2-621c945bb93b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474729} :answer-field/id #uuid "3bca8887-5b74-5643-8790-24799ecf6e6a" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475290} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "065f8e98-a07c-56e1-afb1-7e545dea83dd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474730} {:answer/id #uuid "9a4f6b33-cec5-5deb-a6ed-98744c9c6629" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474731}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9a4f6b33-cec5-5deb-a6ed-98744c9c6629" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474731} :answer-field/id #uuid "87baa62c-d591-522f-be89-ffc490230761" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475291}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "951452dc-b5fb-50d7-8d4f-8b1233b43cf0" :question/math-academy-id "q-223369" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $7?$\n\nI. $447$\n\nII. $406$\n\nIII. $847$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To check if a number is divisible by $7,$ double the last digit, subtract the result from the remaining digits, and then check if the difference is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $447,$ we have that \n\n$$\n44-2(7)=44-14=30\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $447$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $406,$ we have that \n\n$$\n40-2(6)=40-12=28\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $406$ is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $847,$ we have that \n\n$$\n84-2(7)=84-14=70\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $847$ is divisible by $7.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432791 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171933 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b483f9f7-47a9-5725-b1f1-fe0ea39a7e96" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 6"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "656bfbd5-55fb-542c-a9af-9daf94d4db13" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474930} {:answer/id #uuid "c945e1c9-bb91-57da-a00c-3a0a64455f37" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474931}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c945e1c9-bb91-57da-a00c-3a0a64455f37" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474931} :answer-field/id #uuid "505e2ac2-a385-5e64-8ab1-cb519dcd0b6b" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475391} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f5151017-f279-5948-acb5-ce0fcc865bad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474932} {:answer/id #uuid "85cb6a3c-4a52-55d4-8f8f-daeb88d1748d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474933}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f5151017-f279-5948-acb5-ce0fcc865bad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474932} :answer-field/id #uuid "f04ba15f-4e06-5217-af4c-19c44b6a6a8b" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475392} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4dee975e-ca22-59f3-9552-3f9a