5+6=21,$ which is divisible by $3,$ so the number is also divisible by $3.$ Therefore, the number is divisible by $6.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432793 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171932 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "fb8fa39c-a982-569a-b2e0-833c51259711" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 3 or 9"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1023f7e6-e59f-53cd-8a5f-2e42ef71c00f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474320} {:answer/id #uuid "2dc32817-8382-5025-99f0-ad2c0c830416" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474321}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2dc32817-8382-5025-99f0-ad2c0c830416" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474321} :answer-field/id #uuid "854cc33b-b54c-575b-9aca-53389db721ea" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475086} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "74d1237a-6542-55a5-bba7-fcb3cee7fbd0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474322} {:answer/id #uuid "b7496172-4f29-5fe4-805a-7e950c38af31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474323}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "74d1237a-6542-55a5-bba7-fcb3cee7fbd0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474322} :answer-field/id #uuid "f0fc41dc-297b-5c9e-a513-996195713837" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475087} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7e200043-d762-5434-a59e-aa9354b7703d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474324} {:answer/id #uuid "91ad8e9e-37ad-5097-9f17-8d7924c4732b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474325}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "91ad8e9e-37ad-5097-9f17-8d7924c4732b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474325} :answer-field/id #uuid "cef549f3-e13e-5104-8ca9-934b1ad8e331" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475088}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "c9669189-f542-5fc7-9dce-62db6de9555d" :question/math-academy-id "q-132386" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $3?$\n\nI. $935\\,784$\n\nII. $7\\,391\\,123$\n\nIII. $12\\,144\\,801$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $3$ if the sum of its digits is divisible by $3.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $935\\,784$ is\n\n$$\n9+3+5+7+8+4=36,\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $3.$ So, $935\\,784$ is divisible by $3.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $7\\,391\\,123$ is\n\n$$\n7+3+9+1+1+2+3=26,\n$$\n\nwhich is *not* divisible by $3.$ So, $7\\,391\\,123$ is *not* divisible by $3.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $12\\,144\\,801$ is\n\n$$\n1+2+1+4+4+8+0+1=21,\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $3.$ So,  $12\\,144\\,801$ is divisible by $3.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432794 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171932 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "fb8fa39c-a982-569a-b2e0-833c51259711" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 3 or 9"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "80cddcd7-7a10-53d3-a249-589070851828" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474326} {:answer/id #uuid "eaa771f6-3a38-59bc-8b6d-35530580e18f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474327}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "80cddcd7-7a10-53d3-a249-589070851828" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474326} :answer-field/id #uuid "fb94287d-7984-5ed4-af67-720f38cb3605" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475089} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f8859356-e07c-5d6f-9442-820954e24cc0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474328} {:answer/id #uuid "c7dbcfbd-d49d-5299-a267-58bd60023c95" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474329}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f8859356-e07c-5d6f-9442-820954e24cc0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474328} :answer-field/id #uuid "be5d16f2-6f01-5966-ad54-bda278e555a9" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475090} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7f0d690b-a2af-51f1-908f-dcffce79cd11" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474330} {:answer/id #uuid "f3e4a19a-3b1e-52c2-a9b9-12b81d32f9b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474331}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7f0d690b-a2af-51f1-908f-dcffce79cd11" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474330} :answer-field/id #uuid "619d29e9-1652-56eb-a3ec-9f5d3d435236" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475091}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e2757e05-6aab-58ae-aed8-77516507381e" :question/math-academy-id "q-132392" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $9?$\n\nI. $34\\,154\\,119$\n\nII. $9\\,173\\,589$\n\nIII. $733\\,123$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $9$ if the sum of its digits is divisible by $9.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $34\\,154\\,119$ is\n\n$$\n3+4+1+5+4+1+1+9=28,\n$$\n\nwhich is *not* divisible by $9.$ So, $34\\,154\\,119$ is *not* divisible by $9.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $9\\,173\\,589$ is\n\n$$\n9+1+7+3+5+8+9=42,\n$$\n\nwhich is *not* divisible by $9.$ So, $9\\,173\\,589$ is *not* divisible by $9.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $733\\,123$ is\n\n$$\n7+3+3+1+2+3=19,\n$$\n\nwhich is *not* divisible by $9.$ So, $733\\,123$ is *not* divisible by $9.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432795 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171934 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb0ae539-5348-5a2c-b226-c009ce6d6094" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 7"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01d64aae-b4bb-5dea-a20a-c665725ead2c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :