ue" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474725} :answer-field/id #uuid "1a093a01-05c2-5489-916c-e7d8540f516c" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475288}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f0e5ee54-f96c-54ab-8de5-f272c76ac6c8" :question/math-academy-id "q-223365" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $7?$\n\nI. $448$\n\nII. $352$\n\nIII. $217$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To check if a number is divisible by $7,$ double the last digit, subtract the result from the remaining digits, and then check if the difference is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $448,$ we have that \n\n$$\n44-2(8)=44-16=28\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $448$ is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $352,$ we have that \n\n$$\n35-2(2)=35-4=31\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $352$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $217,$ we have that \n\n$$\n21-2(7)=21-14=7\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $217$ is divisible by $7.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432796 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171934 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb0ae539-5348-5a2c-b226-c009ce6d6094" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 7"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9121cec7-c707-581d-8d65-e6975e317841" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474738} {:answer/id #uuid "0909e94b-b592-5c37-a619-583ae74c0539" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474739}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0909e94b-b592-5c37-a619-583ae74c0539" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759218